<title>USA: GOLF-U.S. RYDER CUP TEAM STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-U.S. RYDER CUP TEAM STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>PALM BEACH GARDENS, Florida 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S.</p>
<p>Ryder Cup team standings as issued by the PGA of America on</p>
<p>Monday (top 10 gain automatic berths on the 12-man team for</p>
<p>the matches against Europe, September 26-28 in Spain):</p>
<p>  1. Tom Lehman			 796.290 points</p>
<p>  2. Mark O'Meara		     793.750</p>
<p>  3. Phil Mickelson		   651.790</p>
<p>  4. Steve Jones			579.280</p>
<p>  5. Scott Hoch			 574.280</p>
<p>  6. Mark Brooks			549.750</p>
<p>  7. Davis Love III		   540.000</p>
<p>  8. Tiger Woods			500.000</p>
<p>  9. David Duval			390.000</p>
<p> 10. Kenny Perry			371.250</p>
<p> 11. Tommy Tolles		     364.280</p>
<p> 12. Paul Stankowski		  363.340</p>
<p> 13. Fred Couples		     358.040</p>
<p> 14. Michael Bradley		  357.500</p>
<p> 15. Jim Furyk			  347.500</p>
<p> 16. Steve Stricker		   342.500</p>
